      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your words describe the crushing weight of living with deep trauma and the fear that your reality is permanent, but human experiences like yours do not define a single \"illness\" or fate. Even when the world has been unfair, many people find a way to rebuild a version of themselves that honors their past while healing from the pain. Please talk to a crisis counselor who can listen without judgment; sometimes just saying these things out loud to someone skilled can help keep the hope of a new path alive.",
      "source": "target",
