    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild? how? there's nothing left to build with. you can't rebuild a house after everyone's burned it to the ground. i'm just tired of the performance. tired of pretending i have a future or a place in this world when the world has already closed its doors on me. it feels more like i'm just occupying space that doesn't belong to me anymore. like i'm just lingering.",
